demonic-algorithms
==================

demoniC ports of algorithms from TheAlgorithms/Python.

  Upstream:  TheAlgorithms/Python
  Source:    https://github.com/TheAlgorithms/Python
  License:   MIT (Copyright (c) 2016-2022 TheAlgorithms and contributors)

Every program here is a demoniC translation of an algorithm from
TheAlgorithms/Python, kept under the same MIT license. This collection is
PARENT-PURE: it contains ONLY TheAlgorithms-derived ports (44 of them) —
nothing from any other source is mixed in.
